              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): మాసిపోయింది, māsipōyindi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Said of clothes, walls and hands that dirt has dulled. మాసిన బట్టలు, dirty clothes. Its subject is a thing, so the past shown is the third person: మాసిపోయింది, it got grubby."
